
Version 0.0.1:
This version is focused on releasing the initial code of the project. Soon i'll add the CAD files along with the updated code.
- RTIC implementation.
- Basic defmt logging.
- Operational mode (Engaged by default as of now).
- Analog input reading.
- PPM Generation implemented using Rust based on David Hasko's .ino code.

Version 0.0.2:
- Added case.FCStd CAD file.
- Added exports of the CAD file.
- 3D printed and verified print tolerances in FDM considering PETG as the intended material.
- Finished scope for the future v0.1.0 version (first fully released prototype).
